# Signing keys. 'worldledger identity create' writes one wherever it is told,
# and a committed private key cannot be un-published once it is pushed.
*.key
*.pem

# Produced by scripts/windows-capture-fingerprint.ps1. A measurement of one
# machine at one moment; the reference that CI compares against is committed
# deliberately under testdata/ when both halves agree, not swept up from here.
*-capture-fingerprint.txt

*.tmp
*.log
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
